<BRK/>
[<ITM><SUB>Supports and Attachments</SUB>; <SUB>G<TAI OPT="ARMY">, [_____]</TAI></SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]<ITM><SUB>Equipment Requirements</SUB>; <SUB>G<TAI OPT="ARMY">, [_____]</TAI></SUB></ITM><BRK/>
